            "text": "a. First, regular participation in learning methods helps young people combine face-to-face discussions with flexible online study.\nb. Last but not least, these shared efforts inspire neighbours and classmates to combine traditional and digital learning in modern classrooms.\nc. For all these reasons, mastering the core values of Unit 8: New Ways to Learn is essential for every high school student.\nd. There are three main reasons why educators encourage teachers and students to focus on blended learning, online courses and digital tools in education.\ne. Second, consistent practice makes it possible to help students develop self-study, teamwork and digital research skills over the long term.",
