            "text": "a. First, regular participation in heritage sites helps young people pass down traditional folk arts like Quan Họ and Đờn Ca Tài Tử.\nb. Last but not least, these shared efforts inspire neighbours and classmates to preserve and promote our national heritage across Viet Nam.\nc. For all these reasons, mastering the core values of Unit 6: Preserving Our Heritage is essential for every high school student.\nd. There are three main reasons why educators encourage young people and local artisans to focus on preserving cultural and natural heritage sites across Viet Nam.\ne. Second, consistent practice makes it possible to protect ancient monuments and scenic landscapes from damage over the long term.",
