            "instruction": "Read the following passage and mark the letter A, B, C, D on your answer sheet to indicate the best answer to each of the following questions from 61 to 70.",
            "text": "Which of the following best paraphrases the underlined sentence in paragraph 1?\n<i>“Hunted to near-extinction for its waterproof fur and scent glands by the nineteenth century, the Eurasian beaver is now staging a remarkable comeback that is reshaping flood-management policy.”</i>",
