            "text": "Which of the following best paraphrases the underlined sentence in paragraph 1?\n<i>“Opened in 2008 as a fail-safe backup for humanity’s agricultural diversity, the Svalbard Global Seed Vault now safeguards over 1.2 million seed samples from nearly every country on Earth.”</i>",
