            "text": "Which of the following best paraphrases the underlined sentence in paragraph 1?\n<i>“Signed just two years later in 1987, the Montreal Protocol on Substances that Deplete the Ozone Layer has since phased out 99 percent of ozone-destroying chemicals and is widely hailed as the most successful environmental treaty in history.”</i>",
